Package: biotrace
Type: Package
Title: R Integration for the BioTrace GitHub Action
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-20
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Rohan",
           family = "R",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "phonics-tiffs1i@icloud.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-9225-1775")))
Description: Tools for configuring, validating, running and inspecting
    integrations with the BioTrace GitHub Action, which traces
    biological results from data and code to figures and scientific
    claims. The package provides an R API, a command-line interface,
    GitHub workflow scaffolding, configuration helpers and report
    readers. It does not ship or execute the upstream TypeScript
    engine; BioTrace runs only through its published GitHub Action
    (uses: rotsl/biotrace@v1).
URL: https://rotsl.r-universe.dev/biotrace,
    https://github.com/rotsl/biotrace-r,
    https://github.com/rotsl/biotrace
